{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CatchNotFound"},{"type":"text","value":" component is a component that catches not-found errors thrown by its children, renders a fallback component and optionally calls the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onCatch"},{"type":"text","value":" callback. It resets when the pathname changes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"catchnotfound-props","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CatchNotFound props"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CatchNotFound"},{"type":"text","value":" component accepts the following props:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"props-children-prop","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"props.children"},{"type":"text","value":" prop"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"React.ReactNode"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The component's children to render when there is no error"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"props-fallback-prop","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"props.fallback"},{"type":"text","value":" prop"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(error: NotFoundError) => React.ReactElement"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The component to render when there is an error"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"props-oncatch-prop","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"props.onCatch"},{"type":"text","value":" prop"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(error: any) => void"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A callback that will be called with the error that was thrown by the component's children"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"catchnotfound-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CatchNotFound returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns the component's children if there is no error."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"fallback"},{"type":"text","value":" if there is an error."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { CatchNotFound } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  return (\n    <CatchNotFound\n      fallback={(error) => <p>Not found error! {JSON.stringify(error)}</p>}\n    >\n      <ComponentThatMightThrowANotFoundError />\n    </CatchNotFound>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"catchnotfound-props","text":"CatchNotFound props","level":2},{"id":"props-children-prop","text":"props.children prop","level":3},{"id":"props-fallback-prop","text":"props.fallback prop","level":3},{"id":"props-oncatch-prop","text":"props.onCatch prop","level":3},{"id":"catchnotfound-returns","text":"CatchNotFound returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `CatchNotFound` component is a component that catches not-found errors thrown by its children, renders a fallback component and optionally calls the `onCatch` callback. It resets when the pathname changes.\n\n## CatchNotFound props\n\nThe `CatchNotFound` component accepts the following props:\n\n### `props.children` prop\n\n- Type: `React.ReactNode`\n- Required\n- The component's children to render when there is no error\n\n### `props.fallback` prop\n\n- Type: `(error: NotFoundError) => React.ReactElement`\n- Optional\n- The component to render when there is an error\n\n### `props.onCatch` prop\n\n- Type: `(error: any) => void`\n- Optional\n- A callback that will be called with the error that was thrown by the component's children\n\n## CatchNotFound returns\n\n- Returns the component's children if there is no error.\n- Returns the `fallback` if there is an error.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { CatchNotFound } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  return (\n    <CatchNotFound\n      fallback={(error) => <p>Not found error! {JSON.stringify(error)}</p>}\n    >\n      <ComponentThatMightThrowANotFoundError />\n    </CatchNotFound>\n  )\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: catchNotFoundComponent\ntitle: CatchNotFound Component\n---\n\nThe `CatchNotFound` component is a component that catches not-found errors thrown by its children, renders a fallback component and optionally calls the `onCatch` callback. It resets when the pathname changes.\n\n## CatchNotFound props\n\nThe `CatchNotFound` component accepts the following props:\n\n### `props.children` prop\n\n- Type: `React.ReactNode`\n- Required\n- The component's children to render when there is no error\n\n### `props.fallback` prop\n\n- Type: `(error: NotFoundError) => React.ReactElement`\n- Optional\n- The component to render when there is an error\n\n### `props.onCatch` prop\n\n- Type: `(error: any) => void`\n- Optional\n- A callback that will be called with the error that was thrown by the component's children\n\n## CatchNotFound returns\n\n- Returns the component's children if there is no error.\n- Returns the `fallback` if there is an error.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { CatchNotFound } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  return (\n    <CatchNotFound\n      fallback={(error) => <p>Not found error! {JSON.stringify(error)}</p>}\n    >\n      <ComponentThatMightThrowANotFoundError />\n    </CatchNotFound>\n  )\n}\n```\n"}
